# Fact patterns — confidentiality survival (FP-055 … FP-057)

The three-year MSA period and the five-year NDA period are both live; the agreement input
selects between them, which is why this is a calibration case and not a conflict.

> Using Confidentiality_duration as C

## FP-055 — Northwind MSA § 11.2: three years from disclosure

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp055:
  output computation content C.ConfidentialityDuration

scope TestFp055:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConfidentialityDuration with {
      -- disclosure_date: |2026-06-01|
      -- agreement: C.Agreement.NorthwindMsa
      -- is_trade_secret: false
    }
  assertion computation.obligation_end = |2029-06-01|
  assertion computation.indefinite = false
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp055
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp055 ─
│ computation =
│   ConfidentialityDuration {
│     -- obligation_end: |2029-06-01|
│     -- indefinite: false
│   }
└─
```

## FP-056 — Vertex NDA § 4.2: five years from disclosure

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp056:
  output computation content C.ConfidentialityDuration

scope TestFp056:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConfidentialityDuration with {
      -- disclosure_date: |2026-06-01|
      -- agreement: C.Agreement.VertexNda
      -- is_trade_secret: false
    }
  assertion computation.obligation_end = |2031-06-01|
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp056
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp056 ─
│ computation =
│   ConfidentialityDuration {
│     -- obligation_end: |2031-06-01|
│     -- indefinite: false
│   }
└─
```

## FP-057 — a trade secret survives indefinitely

`obligation_end` is still computed; `indefinite` is the output that governs.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp057:
  output computation content C.ConfidentialityDuration

scope TestFp057:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConfidentialityDuration with {
      -- disclosure_date: |2026-06-01|
      -- agreement: C.Agreement.NorthwindMsa
      -- is_trade_secret: true
    }
  assertion computation.indefinite = true
  assertion computation.obligation_end = |2029-06-01|
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp057
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp057 ─
│ computation =
│   ConfidentialityDuration {
│     -- obligation_end: |2029-06-01|
│     -- indefinite: true
│   }
└─
```
